{"id":"d129a2a28d269042","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-injective-ce-listing.md","title":"无限可枚举集合有单射全枚举","display":"thm-injective-ce-listing — 无限可枚举集合有单射全枚举","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-injective-ce-listing","aliases":["20-thm-injective-ce-listing"],"display":"thm-injective-ce-listing — 无限可枚举集合有单射全枚举","chapter":"2","section":"2.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.1.24(ii)","source_printed_pages":[28],"source_pdf_pages":[64],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-injective-ce-listing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-injective-ce-listing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-injective-ce-listing — 无限可枚举集合有单射全枚举"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.1.24(ii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>64</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span> 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=W_e\">\\(A=W_e\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|=\\omega\">\\(|A|=\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}injective\\text{-}ce\\text{-}listing}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\land\\forall m\\ne n\\ f(m)\\ne f(n)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}injective\\text{-}ce\\text{-}listing}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\land\\forall m\\ne n\\ f(m)\\ne f(n)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>依固定阶段枚举顺序记录首次出现的成员；f(n) 等待第 n+1 个不同成员。无限性保证各次等待停止，且成员恰出现一次。从 e 能统一编译该程序，但当 W_e 有限时，编译所得程序在部分 n 上发散；不能统一识别无限性。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.1.24(ii)；印刷页 28；PDF 第 64 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}$ 为已定义的全可计算函数族限制；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A=W_e","display":false},{"tex":"|A|=\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}injective\\text{-}ce\\text{-}listing}\\vdash\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ [\\operatorname{ran}(f)=A\\land\\forall m\\ne n\\ f(m)\\ne f(n)].","display":true}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"0be375ec387418e3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]] — 章 2；直接提供者 3 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-injective-ce-listing]]"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","4ef1aee16db6b308","e343870c773cb68e"]}